Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, defendant Jolyne\NCujoh is sentenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one interesting Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After 15 years in Green\NDolphin Street State Prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,where she will remain under the\Nwatchful eye of strict guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to pay for her crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you\Nto also have an ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,because somehow I'm going to free\Nmyself from the Sea of Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cry and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cry and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cry and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carry on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A survival day? Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, come and find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me! I'm on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, come and find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming in your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure I can't even know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be any way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'm on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in its thread form,\Nit can travel far distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But it lacks power and is easily damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It becomes strong when\Ngathered. However, it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,can only reach about two\Nmeters in that state.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Could stone ocean break\Nthrough the iron bars no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not gonna happen\Nthe most it could do was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul energy that was brought out by the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,pendant stone escaping\Nprison with this power is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not possible yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I try that I need a better\Nunderstanding of the entire prison's layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey girl with the buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bug, but you got some\Nspare change I can borrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some if I go back to my cell,\Nbut the call I'm on is about to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go get it and pay\Nyou back when I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you could\Nmaybe lend me a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've\Nlast talked to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return it once I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know there's a line?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What line?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been standing behind\Nthat girl for 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for her to finish\Nthat ridiculously long call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wasn't in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass, you gotta be new.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make a reservation\Nto use the phones here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, remember it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, the wait is\Nusually a month long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only supposed to be a\Nfew minutes per phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so how does the wait become a month long?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another one of the\Nseven wonders, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, let me get your\Nplace in line, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why we do\Nthings this way, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear her voice. Mama's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing, Sally?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get the hell away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, we're finished\Ntalking to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can't\Npossibly hate me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only here to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, what you just did was\Nthe worst move you could have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You just lent a dollar to\Nthat blonde girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go make sure she returns it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust, there'll be hell to pay\Nif you don't get that money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm gonna have her return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't just a dollar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of thinking will get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kay, listen to me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing you need to\Nlearn is that lending and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,borrowing money with other\Nprisoners is an absolute Nena.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something you should\Nnever do in the aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just a dollar. Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you think would happen\Nif you were unable to get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that dollar back from the\Nblonde who begged you for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd become like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Word would spread around the\Nplace that the newcomer Jolene
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't even get back a mere\Ndollar that she lent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And in here, rumors spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll keep coming back\Nfor more, just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One after another, every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you run out of money, they'll just\Ntake everything from your body and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know about you, but that sure\Ndoes sound like a living hell to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She lent just a dollar, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the blonde, there she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She went back to her room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like she's got no\Nintention of coming to pay her debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, everything I've\Nsaid has been for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a spare minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, yeah, I'm just reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, this book's a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, about that change I lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering what happened to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course, hon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One dollar, there's no way I'd forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the memory stored in\Nthe old noggin, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it to you later, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me that you have\Nsome back in your cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You went back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd get it to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That obviously means I\Ndon't have it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a big tightwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, while you're here, do you think\Nyou could lend me another ten dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to call my friend\Non the outside and get him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring me enough money to\Npay you back and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you have it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But, girl, hurry up and get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Neil, give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a dollar, so please! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you'd get it later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll pay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Five, n-n-two dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that'll be ten dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in the bathroom after her. Then wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else will want to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it's up to you whether or not you get\Nback the money they extorted from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person who can\Nget you out of this is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll get out of here too. Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner number FE40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be returning to my cell,\Nso please unlock this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Noon tomorrow, a visitor will be coming\Nto see you, but you must not meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you absolutely\Ncannot go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go, you're not the\Nonly one who will be affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something even more unfortunate\Nthan death will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is there a child here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you not hear me\Nsay stand back and wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop grabbing onto\Nthe bars! Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just open it! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen when I say\Nnot to grab on the bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Around noon tomorrow, a\Nvisitor will be arriving,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,although it's not for you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for next door. You get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just informing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to check yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pants are on backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday, Fe40536,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but still, it's your fault for hanging\Non to the bars when I said not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Them's the rules, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already let go, and then\Nyou hit me two more times. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't quite catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, is there something you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a visitor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on your feet, I gotta cuff you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A visitor? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that my mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand on the marker in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to these rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a total of 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be allowed to hold hands, but\Nthere will be no kissing or getting naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Items brought in will be\Nhanded over after inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No speaking in foreign languages either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on what's said, the\Nguard can cut your meeting short.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move from that\Nspot until I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon this visit and\Ngo back to your cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a kid like you even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, in this world, something\Nmore terrifying than death exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm certain that it's happening\Nright here inside these prison walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your cell\Nwhile you still can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama might be here to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And all I want is to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to show her I'm okay and hopefully\Nput her at ease if only just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this with you. Consider\Nit a good luck charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Fb 405 3 6 come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for\Nget your ass in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, did you get the pendant\Nthat I left behind with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Theft of a wallet, and a car, plus a salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My Jolene would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for her, she's only 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll get a slap on the wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to Tokyo, right now, with\Neverything your daughter is going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least wait till tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of father are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The pendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll put me in solitary\Nconfinement for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have come if\NI knew you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get up and open the door. Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I hit him too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, listen close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Contrary to what you might believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the person who framed you for murder\Nand put you here isn't your boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's currently locked up in the\Nmen's section of this penitentiary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a veteran and a sniper\Nwho supposedly can nail
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,his targets through wind\Nspeeds at 20 meters per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,According to an investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,his cataracts have caused his\Nvision to degrade considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who plotted\Neverything, even that car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.52,0:15:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria had his\Nhenchman abduct some random
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,hitchhiker and throw\Nhim in front of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything from hiring\Nthe money-grubbing lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the judge that's sentenced you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and setting up that rich brat\Nwere all orders from John Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of plea bargaining before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, Defendant Jolene Cujo is sentenced\Nto 15 years. Fifteen goddamn years!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for hitting me twice\Nyesterday, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me now, why the hell did this complete\Nstranger decide to throw me in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down. Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a damn seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen john Gloria is after you by\Nputting you in this jail he can dispose of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you at any time he wants but why though\Nbecause of the blood that's running through
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,your veins the blood of the joestars
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,joestars the family\Nname that connects back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to us from a few hundred years ago john\NGloria holds a grudge toward this blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To be able to communicate something to\Nsomeone's heart is a wonderful thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but sometimes remnants are left over,\Nand those remnants are known as grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I was younger, I kicked the ass\Nof the Joestar bloodline's greatest enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Gloria was that man's subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He never met him in person, but I've\Ngot no doubt that they're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though 20 years have passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the blind bastard turned his\Nfanaticism into a motive for his grudge
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this makes no sense i thought you\Nwere supposed to be some kind of?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,scholar what's all this\Nabout enemies and grudges
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,all you need to understand\Nis that you're being
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,targeted right now so i'm\Nhere to bust you out the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,lobby damned have you\Nacquired a stand ability yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,a stand you didn't inherit anything specific\Nfrom me but as my daughter you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,potential did anything weird start happening\Nto you after you received the pendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll take that as a yes it's\Nknown as a stand A stand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you've got one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll escape with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little late to\Ntry acting like a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get thrown in\Nprison for you to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you show love?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no space for you in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take in that shocking story and\Nthat whole stand thing under advisement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go on home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who lit that SIG?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The brand is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard didn't even approach\Nthe table in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from that door now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck, did I just get shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. He's begun his assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,what does the far right of this\Nhallway look like are there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,any windows yeah two or three\Nbut all of them have iron bars on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Them this bullet's the real\Ndeal. It's a sniper round used.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,primarily in long-range rifles\Njohn Gloria definitely fired this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,round wait just a second you\Nsaid that guy was an inmate in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this prison we aren't even allowed\Nto have pens in here is that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,right rifles come in parts if\Nyou divide the pieces you can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,hide them in anything if a\Nsubordinate When it bribes the guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll most likely allow the\Nitems in without inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely, you'll\Nhave the whole damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure that's true, but this\Nis the women's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can\Naim from the men's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially inside a building\Nlike this with so many obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He can with a rifle and a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Jean Gloria is\Nmost definitely a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't show your face too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like that's more\Nthan just a piece of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's moving away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems really light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it's dancing in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make any sudden moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we do anything, we need\Nto determine that thing's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it see my thread or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop raising your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reacting to something else,\Nnot the movement of your thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going in a completely\Ndifferent direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean it's\Nreacting to that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the stuff that the\Nthread's movements created.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, the movement of air?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was reacting to the air currents\Nin order to predict our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if he knew the location,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,how did he shoot a real bullet\Nfrom the men's prison to here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you survived that shot from\Nearlier due to pure luck and coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move until we know\Nthe mechanism of the snipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't order me around like\NI'm just a stupid child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,F.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,F .E. 40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how much trouble\Nyou're in for what you just did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.18,0:21:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reacting to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure you rot\Nin solitary confinement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, I'm gonna enjoy\Nbeating the shit out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, don't move away from the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.73,0:21:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop ordering me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't knock this shithead out\Nagain, we're gonna be totally screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.45,0:21:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you\Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy little whore! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.90,0:24:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
